    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关键词：能量恢复，散文，身心治愈，烟火人间</span></p><span></span><p><span>主要内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目聚焦《我从未如此眷恋人间》这本书中的七辑核心主题，拆解三重能量密码：史铁生作品传递的苦难重生能量，帮人接纳挫折、转化绝望；汪曾祺等笔下的烟火气治愈能量，以一蔬一饭抚平焦虑；自然意象与真挚感情的带来的字样能量，填补了内心的空虚。 在节目最后还有一个惊喜小彩蛋等你发现！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间节点：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a></span></a><span> 选择《我从未如此眷恋人间》：13位文学大家传递生活眷恋</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a></span></a><span> 灵活阅读策略：挑选感兴趣章节，轻松恢复阅读能量</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a></span></a><span> 老舍幽默吐槽马宗荣总迟到：手表只是装饰品，时间观念差得让人哭笑不得</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a></span></a><span> 生活哲学金句：记忆中的痛苦被希望裹上糖衣，苦中作乐</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a></span></a><span> 老舍被一个眼神迷住，写长篇文字悼念瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a></span></a><span> 史铁生打破刻板印象：记者总想听励志故事，却忽略温暖深意</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a></span></a><span> 被馅饼温暖打动，想买更多回馈店主，反被免费赠送</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">50:05</a></span></a><span> 现代人追寻心灵宁静难如上青天：环境静心不静，时间飞逝如电</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3446">57:26</a></span></a><span> 书籍如心灵鸡汤：对抗低谷，滋养身心，让生活更有温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>放弃了---瘸爸演奏</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小瘸/小七</span></p>]]></description>
