  <item>
    <title>特别节目（七）：断更后，我们在成年人世界里跌撞与和解</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f04f6c456ffec65e0237d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f04f6c456ffec65e0237d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Oct 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关键词：</span></p><span></span><p><span>脱离学校的第一课；下班后我们都在干什么；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主要内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>断更的日子里，小七带着全新的身份回归——从校园踏入职场。本期节目小七首次分享这段“找工作→入职适应”的真实历程，更直面核心感受：成年人世界与校园生活的落差感，远比想象中更具体。同时，小七和小瘸也围绕“下班后的时间”展开了一场真实对谈：小七受校园里“高强度、目标感”学习模式的影响，下班后只想彻底放松，拒绝把时间切割成碎片；而小瘸则截然不同，学生时代未被过度施压的状态，反而让他在工作后更能调动自主性，愿意在班后尝试新鲜事物。两种不同的状态碰撞出许多思考，或许也藏着你我面对“身份转换”时的影子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间节点：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a></span></a><span> 从学生到职场新人：适应工作带来的挑战与成长机会</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">00:15:38</a></span></a><span> 毕业即上班与缓两年再就业：不同的生活选择之间的对比与思考</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">00:31:19</a></span></a><span> 适应新环境，寻找新挑战：第二次停更后的我在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">00:36:31</a></span></a><span> 面对新鲜事物的畏难情绪：为什么我们不想尝试新事物？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">00:41:47</a></span></a><span> 生活秩序感的维持：通过打扫卫生来打发时间的方法</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">00:52:14</a></span></a><span> 追求卓越的路上：大学生活中的成长与变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Best Is Yet To Come - Sandro Cavazza</span></p><span></span><p><span>I'm so Tired - Anesti Danelis</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小瘸/小七</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6645f8697cb1c0f727024fa1/lkK0_MNoA7d07klTFSBQ2iej-sus.m4a" length="91054057" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:44</itunes:duration>
